---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Disclaimer" description="Itto-Ryu Tech disclaimer: education only, not investment advice.">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 pt-16 leading-relaxed">
    <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-koke font-medium">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-serif text-4xl font-medium">Disclaimer</h1>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 max-w-[65ch]">
      <p>
        All content on this website, including the indicators, screenshots and examples, is for education only.
        It is not investment advice and not a recommendation to buy, sell or hold any security, futures contract
        or other asset.
      </p>
      <p>
        The author is not licensed by the Securities and Exchange Commission, Thailand, or by any other regulator
        as an investment adviser or investment analyst.
      </p>
      <p>
        Indicators describe market conditions; they do not predict prices. Levels, stops, reference lines and
        labels drawn by any tool are arithmetic outputs of your own inputs, not recommendations. Past behaviour
        does not guarantee future results.
      </p>
      <p>
        Third-party data shown by a tool, such as published ESG ratings, belongs to its publishers and is shown as
        published, without warranty. The indicators and this website are provided as is.
      </p>
      <p>
        Trading involves risk. Futures are leveraged and losses can exceed your initial deposit. Do your own
        research and make your own decisions.
      </p>
      <p class="text-usu">
        Itto-Ryu Tech is not affiliated with or endorsed by TradingView, and is not affiliated with any Ittō-ryū
        school of swordsmanship.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
